    {
      "v": 2,
      "zh": "那时，有我一个弟兄哈拿尼，同着几个人从犹大来。我问他们那些被掳归回、剩下逃脱的犹大人和耶路撒冷的光景。",
      "en": "Hanani, who was one of my relatives,[NOTE:1] along with some of the men from Judah, came to me,[NOTE:2] and I asked them about the Jews who had escaped and had survived the exile, and about Jerusalem.[NOTE:3]",
      "notes": [
        "Heb “brothers.”",
        "The Hebrew text does not include the words “to me”; these words were supplied in the translation for the sake of clarity.",
        "For location see Map5-B1; Map6-F3; Map7-E2; Map8-F2; Map10-B3; JP1-F4; JP2-F4; JP3-F4; JP4-F4."
