      "v": 4,
      "zh": "我听见这话，就坐下哭泣，悲哀几日，在天上的　神面前禁食祈祷，说：",
      "en": "When I heard these things I sat down abruptly,[NOTE:1] crying and mourning for several days. I continued fasting and praying before the God of heaven.",
      "notes": [
        "Heb “sat down.” Context suggests that this was a rather sudden action, resulting from the emotional shock of the unpleasant news, so “abruptly” has been supplied in the present translation."
